оллера автоматического тормоза"]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"s1","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\nОсмотрите кронштейн контроллера автоматического тормоза на наличие трещин, деформаций и повреждений.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\nВ случае возникновения проблемы замените кронштейн контроллера автоматического тормоза.\n"]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n"],"anchors":["AJPHSB0PA126002002","AJPHSB0PA126002003","AJPHSB0PA126002004","L10A203","L10A204","L10A205","L10A206","L10A207","AJPHSB0PA126002005","L10A208","AJPHSB0PA126002006"],"images":[{"sourceName":"IGSA0PA10012.jpg","path":"images/IGSA0PA10012.webp","width":749,"height":389,"sha256":"9d6c0aeb22e815a0f3a337afd91694f6ebaddd02042de29ee72e6356086bc4bb","sourceSha256":"eac793e08e515c67d28079ed6327db53f52704f6fafbb6b0dfbb2a9500c3bfce","sourceBytes":26916},{"sourceName":"IDK80QAA0025.jpg","path":"images/IDK80QAA0025.webp","width":590,"height":497,"sha256":"6617983271532ba2753e083e839df20d540e5b042b3f4c57e3c062e4411e9f5a","sourceSha256":"a7acf1dade50edaa84df65de9669fac71108822b5c7edf89d9fac62435212829","sourceBytes":33105},{"sourceName":"IGSB0AAA1021.jpg","path":"images/IGSB0AAA1021.webp","width":1631,"height":864,"sha256":"d9536333d011f171ecf00ef709e0354faf87edad4076f39bbfcbbb9b57087b7c","sourceSha256":"f4bd5a1860ec87ee5f50214f9663b0e580079fad2e58fd39191b955a98530728","sourceBytes":90843},{"sourceName":"IGSB0AAA1022.jpg","path":"images/IGSB0AAA1022.webp","width":1710,"height":572,"sha256":"1d2947ef64543484af5e9136d4332ab2480ce2be92426f669708308d9c09ed04","sourceSha256":"33e54f8ba721129f20ad60e1d072bf18436ca953b4cba5163bd1e00384e04102","sourceBytes":79438},{"sourceName":"IEAA0BAA0032.swf","path":"images/IEAA0BAA0032.webp","width":1678,"height":828,"sha256":"909e9a98a8f6223451bd74bb1da943dc811d579d273e5d13003b08d2ca33b5e6","sourceSha256":"f929cb12faa2bac24e4bf223292e5a5facc67eaaebcf2728ebb94b425d6a39cb","sourceBytes":73279},{"sourceName":"IGSA0PA10004J.jpg","path":"images/IGSA0PA10